Loops

===========
  Syntax
===========

for var in {1..5}
do
echo $var
done

if you need to do a numerical problem, you need double brackets `$(())` eg to get the table of 2:

for var in {1..5}
do
echo "2 x $var = $(($var*2))"
done

OR

for var in {1..5}
do
answer="$((2*var))"
echo "2 x $var = $answer"
done
